{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53969","headline":"偈 三 · 景岑","name":"偈 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"最甚深，最甚深，法界人身便是心。\n迷者迷心爲衆色（《宗镜录》作「刹」），悟时刹海（《景德传灯录》作「境」）是真心。\n身界二尘无实性（《宗镜录》、《景德传灯录》作「相」），分明达此号知音。\n（《祖堂集》卷十七、《宗镜录》卷九八、《景德传灯录》卷十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"景岑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}